            <ArticleTitle>Massive gastrointestinal bleeding due to cholecystoduodenal fistula. Case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>471-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A young man presenting with massive haematemesis and melaena was found to have a cholecystoduodenal fistula secondary to duodenal ulcer. Surgical treatment was successful.</AbstractText>
